Forgive Marina; she is beside herself. Commander Derik has taken over the operations of the alliance's checkpoint until Zarad returns. Before leaving on the rescue mission, he left these Soul Stones, given by Celina. They can capture the essence of a soul.

The Shogoth are made from Pristonians who were killed or captured by the Black Crystals. The soul energy of the Sathla and Arhdyra keeps the Shogoth's souls under control.
Capture the souls of the oppressors so that Celina can study them.

[Challenge Objective]

Hunt Sathla and Arhdyra and obtain the Blue and Red Souls.
When you are done, talk to Sage Celina in Pillai.
